   "he": "גְּמָ׳ הַשְׁתָּא טְוִי זָבְנִינַן, אָרִיג מִיבַּעְיָא? מַאי ״אָרִיג״? תִּיכֵּי.",
   "en": "«GEMARA:» The Gemara asks: «Now» that the mishna has taught that «we may purchase spun» thread from one who is suspect with regard to the Sabbatical Year, «is» it «necessary» to teach the case of «woven fabric?» The Gemara answers: «What» does the mishna mean when it says: «Woven?» It means wool woven into «chains,» which is not spun."
